  "label": "Michelle Obama is mapped onto the monkey",
  "description": "The text 'clint eastwood and michelle obama' explicitly names Michelle Obama, who is a Black woman. The visual material shows a monkey being held by a man. The meme uses this juxtaposition to map Michelle Obama onto the monkey, invoking the racist stereotype of equating Black people with primates. This mapping is central to the meme's hateful intent, as it dehumanizes Michelle Obama by associating her with an animal.",
